    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>These ladies are packing HEAT! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/5bc8b05587f46d37356ee6119c8b116e.avif?t=1740428757\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futa City is a futa-filled anthology series featuring 5 unique standalone stories, each with their own taste of the taboo. Every story is depicted as a dynamic visual novel, right up until the clothes start flying off. Then we get a whole lot more <i>immersive</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to know more?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/cca7dee136c4f820e5b31a0bbc6ff423.avif?t=1740428757\" width=650 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genre-bender</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From superheroes to reality-tv housewives, our futas are coming from all walks of the wild life. Prepare to wear many hats, and then take them off! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/ada838bcc64602111730e54ed584aef4.avif?t=1740428757\" width=650 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Lovin'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little known fact is that futas find humor in the little things. And so do we! Which is why we\u2019ve written each story to leave you with a laugh.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/5966443f740f1797ab5aaa2ff51c7cae.avif?t=1740428757\" width=650 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Voice Acted Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We let our VAs know what they were getting into ahead of time so thankfully nobody passed out when they received their scripts. The result of their hard work should get you even harder! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/fce859e53277b6a39b703f91b33982b0.avif?t=1740428757\" width=650 height=150 /></span><strong>Gameplay features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in full lustful intercourse with either one or two partners. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/b26028e51e0118d54fd9dab32abe878c.poster.avif?t=1740428757\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/b26028e51e0118d54fd9dab32abe878c.webm?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/b26028e51e0118d54fd9dab32abe878c.mp4?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mouse, VR controllers  to interact with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/90434c0533ce35a9f405eefb1a808705.poster.avif?t=1740428757\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/90434c0533ce35a9f405eefb1a808705.webm?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/90434c0533ce35a9f405eefb1a808705.mp4?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select different poses to keep things interesting for you and your partner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/dac7c5fd4761d2e9a6c01842b131091b.poster.avif?t=1740428757\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/dac7c5fd4761d2e9a6c01842b131091b.webm?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/dac7c5fd4761d2e9a6c01842b131091b.mp4?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful spanking both in PC or VR. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/05b1025be7558ee883caed0a258df2c9.poster.avif?t=1740428757\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/05b1025be7558ee883caed0a258df2c9.webm?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/05b1025be7558ee883caed0a258df2c9.mp4?t=1740428757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach climax by choosing the right moves! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624320/extras/88a11ec598385c6ecb20acec49489c37.poster.avif?t=1740428757\" width=480 height=270 ><source